Have you considered using ssh instead? That way the link's encrypted
and cryptographically authenticated using public keys.

The normal SSH command line packages should build on NT under either
Interix (Windows Services for UNIX 3.5, a free download from Microsoft)
or Cygwin. I would recommend Interix because of certain security problems
in the Cygwin design.

Have you considered using a local user other than Administrator? If you can
do the work with a non-privileged account hat would be safer (principle of
least privilege).

